  "question": {
    "text": "<p>List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> shows different radioactive decay processes and List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math> provides possible emitted particles. Match each entry in List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> with an appropriate entry from List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>, and choose the correct option.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>238</mn></msup><mn>92</mn></msub><mi>U</mi><msub><msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>234</mn></msup><mn>91</mn></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;particle and one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;particle</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>214</mn></msup><mn>82</mn></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>b</mi><msub><msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>210</mn></msup><mn>82</mn></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>b</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>three <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;particles and one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> particle</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>210</mn></msup><mn>81</mn></msub><mi>T</mi><mi>l</mi><msub><msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>206</mn></msup><mn>82</mn></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>b</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>two <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;particles and one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;particle</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msup><mrow/><mn>228</mn></msup><mn>91</mn></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>224</mn></msup><mn>88</mn></msub><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> particle and one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;particle</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> particle and two <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;particles</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>"
